&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Closing&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Sales&amp;nbsp;experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in English is required. Knowledge in any of the Nordics languages is not mandatory but would be highly valuable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
