&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As a Mid-Market Sales Manager, you will be responsible for hiring, training, coaching, and leading a team of new and established Growth Specialists (Account Executives) in a fast-paced and rapidly changing environment. This role is open to remote.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
