&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;899&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;903&quot; data-end=&quot;918&quot;&gt;Who are we?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot is a leading customer platform that brings marketing, sales, service, and operations tools together to help businesses attract, engage, and delight customers. It&#39;s our mission to not just help them grow, but to help them&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;grow better.&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our global team builds with heart, curiosity, and a drive to solve for the customer while doing work that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value flexibility, autonomy, and results over where you’re located. This role is open to remote workers anywhere in Australia, with our ANZ office based in Sydney’s CBD.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1413&quot; data-end=&quot;1437&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1417&quot; data-end=&quot;1437&quot;&gt;What’s the role?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1439&quot; data-end=&quot;1789&quot;&gt;We’re expanding, and we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Account Executive - Mid-Market&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our Sales Team and help medium-sized companies (51-500 FTE) grow better with HubSpot’s full product suite. You’ll be a trusted partner to customers, championing their success through consultative sales, deep product understanding, and strategic relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1791&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;What will you do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1820&quot; data-end=&quot;1878&quot;&gt;Drive new business and consistently exceed sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1881&quot; data-end=&quot;1951&quot;&gt;Develop and manage a strong sales pipeline with accurate forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1954&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;Take a customer-first, consultative approach to understand needs and recommend tailored solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2056&quot; data-end=&quot;2123&quot;&gt;Lead virtual product demonstrations that showcase HubSpot’s value&lt;/li&gt;
