&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;11xacj1&quot; data-start=&quot;208&quot; data-end=&quot;241&quot;&gt;Account Executive, Mid-Enterprise @ Klaviyo!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;242&quot; data-end=&quot;339&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;242&quot; data-end=&quot;255&quot;&gt;Hybrid Role Requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Denver, CO&lt;br data-start=&quot;293&quot; data-end=&quot;296&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;296&quot; data-end=&quot;305&quot;&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Sales – Mid-Enterprise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;500&quot;&gt;At Klaviyo, we believe every customer interaction is an opportunity to build stronger relationships. That mindset starts with our Sales team—and we&#39;re growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;502&quot; data-end=&quot;835&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Mid-Enterprise Account Executive to join our tenured, high-performing team selling into some of the world’s most recognizable brands. This is more than just closing deals. It&#39;s an opportunity to shape the future of our upmarket business by bringing Klaviyo to customers who are reimagining their marketing tech stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;837&quot; data-end=&quot;1041&quot;&gt;From first touch to signed agreement, you’ll own the full sales cycle—partnering closely with teams across Solutions, Customer Success, Product, and Engineering to drive long-term value for our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1043&quot; data-end=&quot;1204&quot;&gt;You’ll be selling to companies like Marc Jacobs, Walmart’s Home Brands, TaylorMade Golf, and Citizen Watches. It’s a big responsibility—and a bigger opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1mh1hp4&quot; data-start=&quot;1206&quot; data-end=&quot;1238&quot;&gt;How You’ll Make a Difference&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1747&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1239&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1305&quot;&gt;Build and grow Klaviyo’s Mid-Market and Enterprise client base&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1306&quot; data-end=&quot;1394&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1308&quot; data-end=&quot;1394&quot;&gt;Drive full-cycle sales efforts: prospecting, discovery, demo, negotiation, and close&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1395&quot; data-end=&quot;1471&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1397&quot; data-end=&quot;1471&quot;&gt;Create and execute territory and account strategies for long-term growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1472&quot; data-end=&quot;1604&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1474&quot; data-end=&quot;1604&quot;&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Solutions Architects, Customer Success, and Marketing to deliver a world-class buying experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1605&quot; data-end=&quot;1661&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1607&quot; data-end=&quot;1661&quot;&gt;Provide mentorship and leadership across the AE team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1662&quot; data-end=&quot;1747&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1664&quot; data-end=&quot;1747&quot;&gt;Share market insights with Product and Engineering to influence roadmap decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1rarndv&quot; data-start=&quot;1749&quot; data-end=&quot;1764&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1765&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1765&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1767&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;Based in the San Francisco Bay Area and available to be in-office 3 days/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1847&quot; data-end=&quot;1912&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1849&quot; data-end=&quot;1912&quot;&gt;6+ years of closing experience, preferably in SaaS or MarTech&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1913&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1915&quot; data-end=&quot;2011&quot;&gt;Comfortable navigating strategic deals with multiple stakeholders and complex buying processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2012&quot; data-end=&quot;2102&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2014&quot; data-end=&quot;2102&quot;&gt;Experienced in technical selling—able to communicate value with clarity and confidence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2103&quot; data-end=&quot;2167&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2105&quot; data-end=&quot;2167&quot;&gt;Knowledge of the marketing automation or CDP space is a plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2168&quot; data-end=&quot;2250&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2170&quot; data-end=&quot;2250&quot;&gt;Resilient in the face of challenges and energized by a fast-moving environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2251&quot; data-end=&quot;2316&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2253&quot; data-end=&quot;2316&quot;&gt;A natural relationship-builder with strong influencing skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2317&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2319&quot; data-end=&quot;2399&quot;&gt;Committed to learning, sharing, and contributing to a high-trust sales culture&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2401&quot; data-end=&quot;2404&quot;&gt;
