&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two to three high-impact bottlenecks are removed, with reproducible benchmarks demonstrating sustained improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our largest customer workloads show measurable improvements in tail latency, throughput, and error rates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multi-region readiness and high-volume migration plans have clear priorities, tested assumptions, and actionable next steps.&lt;/p&gt;
